 "إصدار 2.0.0: export بقت ترجّع Path بدل نص، وPython 3.8 مبقاش مدعوم. اتضاف تصدير Excel وخيار --dry-run. واتصلح تصدير العربي على Windows. وold_export هتتشال في 3.0.": "Version 2.0.0: export now returns a Path instead of a string, and Python 3.8 is no longer supported. Excel export and a --dry-run option were added. Arabic export on Windows was fixed. old_export will be removed in 3.0.",
 "ليه رقم الإصدار اتغيّر من 1 لـ 2؟": "Why did the version number change from 1 to 2?",
